@startuml
actor Student
participant ScienceQuizActivity as UI
participant GenerateScienceQuizUseCase as UseCase
participant AdaptiveQuizPolicy as Policy
participant QuizAttemptRepository as Attempts
participant QuizVariationRepository as Variations
participant ScienceQuizGenerator as Generator

Student -> UI: Select subject, level, topic, 3–5 questions
UI -> UseCase: execute(userId, baseRequest)
UseCase -> Policy: adapt(userId, baseRequest)
Policy -> Attempts: getRecentPerformance(subject, same level)
Policy -> Variations: getRecentPrompts(subject, same level)
Policy --> UseCase: request(level unchanged, challenge, seed, exclusions)
UseCase -> Generator: generateQuiz(adaptedRequest)
alt Gemini succeeds
  Generator --> UseCase: new AI questions
else key/network/model unavailable
  Generator --> UseCase: shuffled local questions
end
UseCase -> Variations: rememberPrompts(best effort)
UseCase --> UI: GeneratedQuiz
Student -> UI: Submit answers
UI -> Attempts: save score(best effort)
UI --> Student: Feedback and next same-level challenge mode
@enduml
